# Licensing of the data in this directory

The **code** in this repository is MIT (see ../LICENSE). The **data** is not, and it
is not uniform either. Check the `license` field on each item — every record carries
its own — and treat the table below as the summary.

| Files | Items | License | Origin |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `srb_grammar/items.jsonl`, `srb_idioms/items.jsonl`, `srb_cyrillic_agreement/items.jsonl`, `srb_grammar_cloze/items.jsonl` | 130 | CC BY 4.0 | written for this project |
| `srb_probe/*.jsonl` (hand-written) | 87 | CC BY 4.0 | written for this project |
| `srb_probe/*.synth.jsonl` | 32 | CC BY-SA 4.0 | word forms from srLex |
| `srb_pravopis/*.jsonl` | 82 | CC BY 4.0 | written for this project |
| `srb_correction/*.jsonl` | 90 | inherits its source item's license | derived from the items above |
| `official/*.jsonl` | 355 | per item (307 CC BY 4.0, 48 CC BY-SA 4.0) | the official set, selected from the above |
| `srb_grammar_cloze/candidates.jsonl` | 453 | CC BY-SA 4.0 | derived from UD_Serbian-SET |
| `srb_grammar_cloze/candidates-synth.jsonl` | 519 | CC BY-SA 4.0 | word forms from srLex |
| `forms.txt.gz` | 1.45M forms | CC BY-SA 4.0 | derived from srLex |

## Why two licenses

CC BY-SA is share-alike: a work derived from it must be released under the same terms.
Items mined from the treebank, items built from srLex forms, and the form index are all
derivatives, so they inherit BY-SA and cannot be relicensed as CC BY or MIT. The
hand-written items are original to this project and are CC BY 4.0.

If you redistribute the BY-SA files or anything derived from them, you must keep them
under CC BY-SA 4.0 and preserve the attributions below.

## Attribution

**UD_Serbian-SET** — Universal Dependencies Serbian SET treebank.
Samardžić, Tanja; Miletić, Aleksandra; Ljubešić, Nikola. CC BY-SA 4.0.
https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_Serbian-SET

**srLex 1.3** — Inflectional lexicon of Serbian.
Ljubešić, Nikola. CLARIN.SI. CC BY-SA 4.0.
https://www.clarin.si/repository/xmlui/handle/11356/1233

Neither source is vendored in this repository beyond the derived files listed above.

## Verification status

Each item's status is in `official/MANIFEST.json` for the official set:
- `human`: checked by a native speaker;
- `consensus`: on the verification core list, and fewer than two of the four strongest
  models disagreed with its gold;
- `derived`: a correction item built from an official item.

Model consensus is not human verification. Everything outside the official set is
unverified, including the mined and synthesised cloze pools. Do not publish results computed
on those pools.
